ontainer-3664964732.tss-wrapper .tss-isotope5 .item-content-wrapper,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t#tss-container-3664964732.tss-wrapper .tss-carousel10 .item-content-wrapper{background: transparent;}<\/style><div class='rt-container-fluid tss-wrapper ' id='tss-container-3664964732'  data-layout='layout1' data-desktop-col='1'  data-tab-col='2'  data-mobile-col='1'><div data-title='Loading ...' class='rt-row tss-layout1 tss-even '><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Kaye Mun\u010ds, Global Thermoelectric (Calgary, AB)\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Kaye Mun\u010ds, Global Thermoelectric (Calgary, AB)<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">I really, really appreciate all your help, especially on this project.\u00a0 You have been a lifesaver!<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Merilyn, Eastcoal Inc.\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Merilyn, Eastcoal Inc.<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">ABC Language Solutions is our first choice language service provider because we can always count on them to deliver high-quality translations on time. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Due to their convenient location and excellent customer support, it is always a pleasure to work with them. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Because they've been providing a consistent linguistic support for our mining projects in Ukraine, we recommend them to anyone who needs a reliable professional language services provider.<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Jason-Trends Electronics International Inc. (Vancouver)\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Jason-Trends Electronics International Inc. (Vancouver)<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We have worked with several translation vendors in the past, but now we mostly use ABC Language Solutions translation services because they are fast and reliable. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">They have been helping us promote international products from China and the US to Canadian markets by providing us with French translations. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Their last translation allowed us to accomplish <strong>a $250,000 deal<\/strong> by successfully introducing a new car product into Canadian stores, including Best Buy. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you want high-quality. fast translations, we recommend working with ABC Language Solutions.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n\r\n<b><i>\"Thank you for providing the alternatives, I have a French speaking sales rep too! I will go with ABC way!\"<\/i><\/b><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Wayne, Diamond (Vancouver)\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-1-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Wayne, Diamond (Vancouver)<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Fast and accurate communication with our partners and suppliers is a core issue to us especially now when we are trying to expand not only locally but internationally as well. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">ABC Language Solutions helps us achieve our goals by providing fast and accurate translation of large volumes of documents on a very short notice. We would recommend them to anybody who needs fast and reliable translation service. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">ABC Language Solutions were recommended to us by reliable sources and since speed, time and quality are 3 most important factors for us, we are happy to be working with them. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Confidentiality is also a big issue for us. There are lots of cheaper alternatives out there, but we need to be sure that all ethical principles that are standard in the Western world have been followed. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">With ABC Language Solutions, we are confident that our sensitive information is treated with the utmost care and our requests are processed with high degree of confidentiality.<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Mary Neckhem\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-1-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Mary Neckhem<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\">Very considerate of time deadlines. The staff is professional and thorough. I was very happy with the final product they produced.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Dain Linkeln\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Dain Linkeln<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\">Very considerate of time deadlines. The staff is professional and thorough. I was very happy with the final product they produced.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/